$MDESC::Type = "Challenge Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Practice" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Terra IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 1" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> are training hard in a secret base on the secluded planet Terra IV. The base features top of the line equipment, designed to help hone sniping skills. Computer generated AI are created by the touch of a switch. If gunning down holograms isn't your idea of a good use of time, there are areas designed for duels.";